++|---|---|
++| `kotlinx-coroutines-core-1.10.2.klib.api` | https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.coroutines/blob/1.10.2/kotlinx-coroutines-core/api/kotlinx-coroutines-core.klib.api |
